sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Gradio UI
    participant Model as YOLOv8 Model
    participant Tiler as Tile Inference
    participant Heatmap as Heatmap Generator
    participant Storage as File Storage

    User->>UI: Upload image
    UI->>Storage: Read input image
    alt Single image mode
        UI->>Model: Run detection
        Model-->>UI: Bounding boxes
    else Large image mode
        UI->>Tiler: Run tile inference
        Tiler->>Model: Detect on tiles
        Model-->>Tiler: Tile detections
        Tiler-->>UI: Merged detections
    end
    UI->>Heatmap: Generate heatmap
    Heatmap-->>UI: Heatmap
    UI-->>User: Show results
    UI->>Storage: Save outputs
